# A .uidx file is the thing this repo formats, and `uidx fmt` is what formats it.
# Prettier would parse the MDX and reprint it, which is precisely the "never
# reprint" rule the format engine exists to uphold.
*.uidx

# Prose, hand-wrapped on purpose. The backlog and the ADRs are documents people
# read top to bottom, and reflowing them produces a diff nobody can review for a
# change nobody asked for. Code is what a formatter earns its keep on.
*.md
